Read pixel data from tempTex to inputTex either asynchronously or synchronously
Call UpdateTexture() method
Load the updated raw pixel data from inputData to inputTex
Apply the changes to inputTex
Copy the pixel data from inputTex to tempTex
Flip the image again
Copy the pixel data from tempTex to the RenderTexture for the camera

